A compact, reusable capsule for fast urine-based disease screening

Patent filed & under processing 

📌 Overview

The Trisense Capsule is a portable, low-cost, and reusable urine analysis device designed to detect multiple health conditions in a single test. The system integrates three chemically isolated sensing zones capable of identifying glucose (diabetes), albumin (kidney disorders), and infection-related markers. Each sensing region is separated to prevent cross-reaction and ensure reliable measurements.

The capsule includes a smart moisture-based auto-wake system, an ESP32 microcontroller, an LMP91000 potentiostat, and a precision analog amplification stage to capture biochemical signals. Once processed, the data is transmitted wirelessly to a smartphone or laptop—no internet required.

🎯 Key Features

Multi-parameter urine testing in a single capsule

